   "source": [
    "# Developer Portfolio Tech Stack Predictor - ML Experiment Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the Machine Learning methodology behind the **Developer Portfolio Tech Stack Predictor** application.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Pipeline Overview:\n",
    "1. **Dataset Loading**: Load curated technology skills, roles, and candidate technology stacks.\n",
    "2. **Data Preprocessing & Skill Normalization**: Standardize technology tags and aliases.\n",
    "3. **Feature Engineering**: Vectorize technology profiles into TF-IDF numerical feature spaces.\n",
    "4. **Cosine Similarity Matrix**: Calculate mathematical similarity between developer profiles and candidate stacks using:\n",
    "   $$\\text{Similarity}(A, B) = \\frac{A \\cdot B}{\\|A\\| \\|B\\|}$$\n",
    "5. **Recommendation Evaluation**: Evaluate stack fit, gap coverage, and target role relevance."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from sklearn.feature_extraction.text import TfidfVectorizer\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics.pairwise import cosine_similarity\n",
    "\n",
    "# Sample candidate technology stacks\n",
    "stacks = [\n",
    "    {\"name\": \"Modern Full-Stack Python & React\", \"techs\": \"React TypeScript FastAPI PostgreSQL Docker Git\"},\n",
    "    {\"name\": \"Full-Stack Node.js Enterprise (MERN+TS)\", \"techs\": \"React TypeScript Node.js Express.js MongoDB Redis Docker\"},\n",
    "    {\"name\": \"Production AI & Machine Learning Pipeline\", \"techs\": \"Python PyTorch FastAPI Scikit-learn Pandas NumPy Docker\"},\n",
    "    {\"name\": \"Generative AI & LLM Agent Stack\", \"techs\": \"Python LangChain FastAPI React PostgreSQL Docker TypeScript\"},\n",
    "    {\"name\": \"Cloud Native DevOps Stack\", \"techs\": \"Docker Kubernetes AWS Terraform CI/CD Linux Python\"}\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "df_stacks = pd.DataFrame(stacks)\n",
    "print(\"Candidate Tech Stacks:\")
    "df_stacks"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Vectorize candidate stacks using TF-IDF\n",
    "vectorizer = TfidfVectorizer(token_pattern=r\"(?u)\\b[\\w\\+\\#\\.\\-]+\\b\")\n",
    "tfidf_matrix = vectorizer.fit_transform(df_stacks[\"techs\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Simulate Developer Skill Profile\n",
    "user_skills = \"Python React FastAPI PostgreSQL Git\"\n",
    "user_vec = vectorizer.transform([user_skills])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Compute Cosine Similarities\n",
    "sim_scores = cosine_similarity(user_vec, tfidf_matrix)[0]\n",
    "\n",
    "df_stacks[\"Cosine_Similarity\"] = sim_scores\n",
    "df_stacks = df_stacks.sort_values(by=\"Cosine_Similarity\", ascending=False)\n",
    "print(\"Recommendation Rankings:\")\n",
    "df_stacks[[\"name\", \"Cosine_Similarity\"]]"
   ]
  }
 ],
